{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GROWING EPISODIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ever-expanding star map will add new gameplay types, levels and other seasonal content all in the same game. Episode 1: The Can will introduce PVP multiplayer modes. Future chapters will introduce monster hunts, smuggling runs, heists, hits and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/Barrel_Kill.gif?t=1737497276\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASSIVELY MODULAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mod Cards can change the game as easily as playing a card. Build new games to fit your play style from a large collection of cards to change movement, game rules, weapon effects, gravity, visual effects, levels and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RPG MEETS ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different character races, classes, weapon affinities and magic abilities as you explore and forge your own in the Vital Systems Gameverse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EMBRACE THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With modular levels, modular rules, character magic, and a huge arsenal of weapons\u2026 you may never play the same game in the same way twice. Realism is overrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/GrappleGravity.gif?t=1737497276\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445410?t=1737497276","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737497276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/1dccfc08380b0583908e1d82aa0e828e0196cf3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737497276","capsule_imagev5":"